WEBVTT

00:10:26.752 --> 00:10:31.980
and we often adapt and adopt
to various environmental situations.

00:10:32.282 --> 00:10:34.187
This field of geodesign

00:10:34.211 --> 00:10:37.497
is about bringing geographic
systems and knowledge

00:10:37.521 --> 00:10:39.102
into the design process

00:10:39.126 --> 00:10:42.346
so that we can actually
be guided by nature

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.790
and be more sensitive to it

00:10:44.814 --> 00:10:48.898
so that we can be responsive
to the greater forces of the environment

00:10:48.922 --> 00:10:52.243
and do it in such a way
that we can take --

00:10:52.267 --> 00:10:54.879
it's thinking of the world as a garden.

00:10:54.903 --> 00:10:57.666
It's like gardening,

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.299
you must pull out the weeds,
you nurture your plants,